# One more important distinction for your learning

You currently have **three different concepts mixed together**, and separating them will make GitHub Actions much easier for you.

### CI

```text
Checkout
↓
Setup Python
↓
Dependencies
↓
Tests
↓
Lint
```

Question:

> **"Is my code good enough to deploy?"**

### CD

```text
Deploy
↓
Restart
↓
Health Check
```

Question:

> **"Can I deliver this code to the environment successfully?"**

### Runtime / Operations

```text
Supervisor
↓
Process monitoring
↓
Logs
↓
Restart
↓
Health
```

Question:

> **"Is my application running properly on the server?"**

